            "content": "Before making ANY code changes, perform a COMPLETE architectural audit of the Staff Authentication system.\n\nDo NOT modify code yet.\n\nI want to fully understand the current implementation.\n\n==================================================\nSTAFF AUTHENTICATION AUDIT\n==================================================\n\nAnalyze the COMPLETE login lifecycle from registration to logout.\n\nProduce a detailed report with file names, function names, API endpoints, database tables, and data flow.\n\n==================================================\n1. Registration (Sign Up)\n==================================================\n\nTrace the complete flow.\n\nShow:\n\n\u2022 React component\n\u2022 Hook\n\u2022 Service\n\u2022 API endpoint\n\u2022 PHP file\n\u2022 Database table\n\u2022 SQL executed\n\u2022 Session created?\n\u2022 Approval required?\n\u2022 Password hashing\n\u2022 Validation\n\u2022 Audit log\n\n==================================================\n2. Admin Approval\n==================================================\n\nTrace complete flow.\n\nShow:\n\n\u2022 UI\n\u2022 Hook\n\u2022 Service\n\u2022 API\n\u2022 PHP\n\u2022 Database updates\n\u2022 Status changes\n\u2022 Role assignment\n\u2022 Audit logging\n\n==================================================\n3. Staff Login\n==================================================\n\nTrace every function.\n\nShow:\n\nReact Component\n\u2193\n\nHook\n\u2193\n\nService\n\u2193\n\nAPI\n\u2193\n\nPHP\n\u2193\n\nMiddleware\n\u2193\n\nDatabase\n\u2193\n\nSession creation\n\u2193\n\nResponse\n\nInclude every function involved.\n\n==================================================\n4. Session Storage\n==================================================\n\nIdentify EVERY place authentication data is stored.\n\nCheck for:\n\n\u2022 localStorage\n\u2022 sessionStorage\n\u2022 IndexedDB\n\u2022 storageAdapter\n\u2022 hybridStorage\n\u2022 cookies\n\u2022 PHP session\n\u2022 user_sessions table\n\u2022 React Context\n\u2022 useState\n\u2022 in-memory cache\n\nFor each item explain:\n\nWhat is stored\n\nWhy\n\nHow long\n\nWhether it is acceptable\n\n==================================================\n5. Cross Device Login\n==================================================\n\nDetermine whether login works across:\n\nLaptop\n\nDesktop\n\nMobile\n\nTablet\n\nDifferent browsers\n\nExplain exactly why.\n\nIf not,\n\nidentify the root cause.\n\n==================================================\n6. Session Restore\n==================================================\n\nTrace page refresh.\n\nExplain:\n\nHow verifySession() works\n\nWhat API is called\n\nWhat happens if token expires\n\nWhat happens after browser restart\n\n==================================================\n7. Logout\n==================================================\n\nTrace logout completely.\n\nShow:\n\nFrontend\n\nService\n\nAPI\n\nPHP\n\nDatabase\n\nCookies\n\nMemory\n\n==================================================\n8. Remaining Browser Storage\n==================================================\n\nSearch the ENTIRE project.\n\nFind every remaining reference to:\n\nlocalStorage\n\nsessionStorage\n\nstorageAdapter\n\nstorage.getItem()\n\nstorage.setItem()\n\nIndexedDB\n\nCache API\n\nService Worker\n\nList every business-data key.\n\n==================================================\n9. Registry Loading\n==================================================\n\nExplain exactly how these are loaded.\n\nDoctor Registry\n\nPatient Registry\n\nAudit Log\n\nSite Config\n\nDoctor Content\n\nAre they loaded from:\n\nMySQL\n\nAPI\n\nBrowser storage\n\nMemory\n\nor multiple places?\n\n==================================================\n10. Security Review\n==================================================\n\nCheck:\n\nPassword hashing\n\nSession fixation\n\nSession hijacking\n\nCSRF\n\nXSS\n\nSQL Injection\n\nAuthorization\n\nRole checking\n\nPermission matrix\n\nSession expiration\n\nRefresh token\n\nCookie flags\n\nhttpOnly\n\nSecure\n\nSameSite\n\n==================================================\n11. Final Architecture Diagram\n==================================================\n\nCreate a complete flow diagram.\n\nBrowser\n\n\u2193\n\nReact\n\n\u2193\n\nHooks\n\n\u2193\n\nServices\n\n\u2193\n\nAPI\n\n\u2193\n\nPHP\n\n\u2193\n\nMiddleware\n\n\u2193\n\nMySQL\n\nHighlight every place where browser storage is still involved.\n\n==================================================\n12. Final Summary\n==================================================\n\nList:\n\n\u2713 What is correct\n\n\u26a0 What is duplicated\n\n\u274c What is wrong\n\n\u274c What still depends on browser storage\n\n\u274c What breaks cross-device login\n\n\u274c What should be removed\n\nDo NOT modify any code.\n\nI want only a complete architectural audit of the Staff Login system first.",
