2705 PASS | `session_regenerate_id(true)` called on login |\n| **Session hijacking** | \u26a0\ufe0f PARTIAL | No IP binding or User-Agent verification on `user_sessions`. Token is 128 hex chars (64 bytes random) \u2014 brute-force infeasible. Last activity tracking exists but no session timeout on inactivity. |\n| **CSRF** | \u26a0\ufe0f PARTIAL | `generateCsrfToken()` \/ `validateCsrfToken()` \/ `requireCsrfToken()` exist in middleware but are **never called** by any auth endpoint. Cookie SameSite=Lax provides some protection. |\n| **XSS** | \u26a0\ufe0f PARTIAL | `sanitizeString()` calls `strip_tags()` + `htmlspecialchars()`. CSP header is set. But input is sanitized inconsistently across endpoints. |\n| **SQL Injection** | \u2705 PASS | All queries use PDO prepared statements with named parameters |\n| **Authorization (Staff \u2192 Admin)** | \u2705 PASS | `requireAdmin()` checks `users.role = 'admin'` before approve\/reject\/reassign |\n| **Authorization (Patient approval)** | \u2705 PASS | `requireAuth()` (any authenticated user) can approve patient logins |\n| **Permission matrix** | \u2705 PASS | `hasPermission()` in middleware defines permissions per role. `requirePermission()` enforces. Used by other endpoints. |\n| **Session expiration** | \u2705 PASS | `expires_at` column in `user_sessions`, checked on every request (`WHERE expires_at > NOW()`) |\n| **Refresh token** | \u274c NOT IMPLEMENTED | No refresh token mechanism. `refresh_token` column exists in `patient_sessions` but is never populated or checked. |\n| **Cookie: httpOnly** | \u2705 PASS | `'httponly' => true` |\n| **Cookie: Secure** | \u2705 PASS | `'secure' => true` |\n| **Cookie: SameSite** | \u2705 PASS | `'samesite' => 'Lax'` |\n| **HSTS** | \u2705 PASS | `Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15768000` over HTTPS |\n| **Rate limiting** | \u2705 PASS | Per-IP rate limiting via file-based mechanism |\n| **Audit logging** | \u2705 PASS | Every login attempt, approval, rejection logged to `audit_logs` table |\n\n### Specific Issues Found:\n1. **`validatePasswordStrength()` is defined but not called** in `register.php` \u2014 it only checks `strlen($password) < 6`\n2. **CSRF functions exist but are not used** by any auth endpoint\n3. **No inactivity timeout on server** \u2014 `user_sessions` has `last_activity` but no auto-expiry based on inactivity\n4. **No IP binding for sessions** \u2014 a stolen token\/cookie can be used from any IP\n5. **`update_profile.php` has wrong include path**: `require_once __DIR__ . '\/..\/auth\/middleware.php'` \u2014 correct would be `'.\/middleware.php'`\n\n---\n\n## 11. ARCHITECTURE DIAGRAM\n\n```\n\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n\u2502                              BROWSER                                        \u2502\n\u2502                                                                             \u2502\n\u2502  \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510    \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510    \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510  \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   React App       \u2502    \u2502   React Query    \u2502    \u2502  Service Worker      \u2502  \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502   (SPA)           \u2502    \u2502   (cache layer)  \u2502    \u2502  (static assets only)\u2502  \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502                   \u2502    \